	// Takes a body of the `application/json` content type.
	//
	// Puts a reminder on the entry. offset_spec has two forms and no third: REL:<duration> is an ISO-8601 duration counted from the due date, so the entry needs one - without it there is no moment to fire at - and ABS:<instant> is a fixed moment no due date moves. A preset is a client's vocabulary for a common offset; what travels is the offset itself.
