	// stored" and "off" are different facts. The categories are `notification_categories` in
	// `/meta/capabilities`; a client renders the form from that list rather than compiling it in.
	//
	// The caller's own are read with the token scope alone; somebody else's asks for the member
	// management permission, the reason `PATCH /accounts/{accountId}/preferences` gives.
	//
	// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
