// VerifyAuditChainWithBodyWithResponse Verify the integrity of the audit chain
//
// Checks the hash chain and the absence of gaps over a period. Requires the `audit:read`
// scope and the right to the whole trail: a chain checked over one actor's entries would be
// a chain with every other entry missing, and would answer "broken" for a trail that is
// intact.
//
// A clean check records nothing. A break is recorded as a critical entry of its own,
// because an auditor reading the trail months later has to be able to see that somebody
// noticed, and when.
