// UpdateDataSubjectRequestWithBodyWithResponse Move a case along
//
// The state machine is `RECEIVED → IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED | REJECTED`, and an illegitimate
// transition is refused by name rather than ignored. Moving an `ACCESS`, `PORTABILITY` or
// `ERASURE` case to `IN_PROGRESS` is what starts the work: the archive or the erasure runs as
// a job, and the case is completed by that job rather than by a second call.
